STEP 1: Create Categories

1.1 Create "Online Test Paper"

Url:
POST {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam/category

Body payload (JSON):
    "name": "Online Test Paper",
    "parent_id": null

1.2 Create "GCSE Papers" (under Papers, id: 2)
Body payload (JSON):
name: GCSE Papers
parent_id: 2

STEP 2: Get Categories
Get Root Categories
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam/categories

2.2 Get Children of "Papers"
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam/categories?parent_id=2

2.3 Get Full Tree
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam/category-tree

STEP 3: Create Mock Exams
