STEP 4: Get Mock Exams
4.1 Get All Exams
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam

4.2 Filter by Category
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam?category_id=4

4.3 Filter by Format
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam?format=2

4.4 Multiple Filters
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam?format=2&category_id=4

STEP 5: Get Single Exam
5.1 Get Exam with Questions
GET {{base_url}}/api/admin/mock-exam/1


